From: TickTrade Workbench <hmodebdwie1@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:27:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(creator): add the Creator Platform admin page to the
 round-12 admin

Round 12 contains no creator admin code. Adds CreatorPlatform.jsx/.css and the
same 4-line registration in AdminDashboard/index.jsx (import, menuGroups single
entry gated on creator.view, allMenuItems entry, activeTab branch).
AdminDashboard/index.jsx is byte-identical between round 9 and round 12, so the
registration applies verbatim and no round-12 admin work is touched.
